  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project development objective is  to assist the ministry of Labor and Social Services to pilot(In two pilot districts of Chivi and Shurugwi) a labor intensive public works program, providing temporary employment opportunities to unemployed people in Zimbabwe, while at the same time building community assets that support productive activit.</narrative>
